at's on the Austin manifest, it goes in the report. The window's shut.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^If she told you what's on the Austin manifest, that's grounds to move the team.","\n","^The traffic on their share says the same, if you'd rather not rest it on one frightened engineer.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.22"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"topic_traffic":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"traffic_discussed","re":true},"^I've read it. One authority signing for all four. One operation wearing four coats.","\n","^And the Austin row says nine days, not ninety. The brief was cooked.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"team_redirected"},{"VAR?":"team_assignment"},"str","^trojan_horse","/str","==","||","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^The team's in Austin. That's where this says they should be.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.19"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"redirect_window_closed"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^The window's shut. It goes in the report.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"team_assigned"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^While the window's open, it's enough to move the team on.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^The team's still waiting on your call. If you're making it now, that's where it goes.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.19"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"topic_mercer":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"mercer_discussed","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"mercer_ko"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["^ On the floor, is he. The sequence never needed him awake. The host decides.",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["^Blackout himself. James Mercer, twenty years a Department of Energy grid engineer. Then he built the failure he'd warned about.",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],"nop","\n","^He read the projection and signed it. Nobody was talking him down.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"mercer_fate"},"str","^arrested","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["^ He'll talk. He's waited twenty years for a room that has to listen.",{"->":".^.^.^.22"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["ev",{"VAR?":"mercer_fate"},"str","^escaped","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["^ You let him walk. That's in the log, in your words.",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["^He never got to say his piece. He'll mind that more than the cell.",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],"nop",{"->":".^.^.^.22"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"topic_tomb":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"tomb_discussed","re":true},"^Tomb Gamma. The Architect's workshop, where tonight was put together. No coordinates. He doesn't keep an address.","\n","^Bag it. That's what we work from next.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"topic_teacher":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"teacher_discussed","re":true},"^...Read me that again.","\n","^Narrator: You read it back to her. The line stays quiet for longer than she usually lets it.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"hurt_line_said"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You've heard me say it. I say it to every agent I run.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.13"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^That's something I say. To every agent I run.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.13"},null]}],"nop","\n","^I didn't make it up. Somebody taught it to me, a long time ago. Somebody who taught a lot of us.","\n","^Leave it with me. And keep it out of your notes for now.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"topic_mole":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"mole_discussed","re":true},"^Narrator: A long pause on the line.","\n","^Slowly. I want to be sure I'm hearing this.","\n","^He had your deployment before the order went out. Somebody handed ENTROPY you, by name.","\n","^I'll tell Netherton myself. Not on this line.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"grid_saved"},{"VAR?":"countdown_expired"},"!","&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You still saved eight point four million people.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.19"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"grid_saved"},{"VAR?":"countdown_expired"},"&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You still held most of three states, with Seattle gone for a while.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.27"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"grid_saved"},"!","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^And the grid's still yours to hold, so hold it first.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.34"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Get that intercept out of the building. It's the first thread of whatever comes next.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"vm_hint_1":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"vm1_hint_given","re":true},"^Start with their backup server. It has an NFS share open to anyone. Read it, don't change it.","\n","^It points at their coordination file, and there's a flag in it. Note any account name. You'll want it later.","\n","^The NFS and netcat guide has the commands.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"vm_hint_2":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"vm2_hint_given","re":true},"^Scan every port on the host, not just the common ones. The recon guide has the step.","\n","^Something up there talks to anyone who connects. Read what it says.","\n","^Submit its flag and the relay hands you the capture. The control room password's in it, so you won't need anyone's help with that door.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"vm_hint_3":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"vm3_hint_given","re":true},"^You've got a name from the share and a password from the listener. That's one SSH login. The flag's in its home directory.","\n","^But open the control room door first. The moment you log in, assume they see you and start the clock.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"projection_revised"},{"VAR?":"team_assigned"},"&&",{"VAR?":"team_assignment"},"str","^trojan_horse","/str","!=","&&",{"VAR?":"team_redirected"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"redirect_window_closed"},"!","&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^And if you mean to move the team, do it before you log in. Once they see you, it stays where it is.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.26"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"vm_hint_4":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"vm4_hint_given","re":true},"^A user shell can't kill their job. You need root.","\n","^Start with what this account may run. The privilege escalation guide covers the rest.","\n","^Put the root flag through the relay, then give the console in the control room its abort.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"topic_park":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"park_hint_given","re":true},"^They told him about a building. Mercer's signed projection is on the console in the control room.","\n","^Put the number in front of him.","\n","^He won't wait for a third look. Have it in your hand when you go back down.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"vault_hint":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"vault_hint_given","re":true},"ev",{"VAR?":"hollis_resolved"},"str","^talked","/str","==",{"VAR?":"elena_outcome"},"str","^turned","/str","==","||","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You've been told already. The plate on the transfer switch, in this hall. Last four of the serial.","\n",{"->":"hub"},{"->":".^.^.^.18"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"found_coordination_traffic"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^OptiGrid reset it, and their site notes say how. Read the Portland block in what the relay pulled.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.25"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"flag1_submitted"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^The relay's already pulled their notes off the share for you. Read them. The Portland block.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Their own site notes will say how. Get the share through the relay and read what comes back.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.25"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"guide_rfid":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"rfid_guide_hint_given","re":true},"#","^give_item:lab-workstation:m07_rfid_field_guide","/#","^RFID cloning guide's on your terminal.","\n","^The reader trusts the card and never asks who's holding it.","\n","^Hollis's badge works, and so does a copy: stand close while he talks and the cloner reads it. Or the badge station behind his desk.","\n","^Quiet and quick. Go.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"guide_lockpicking":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"lockpicking_guide_hint_given","re":true},"#","^give_item:lab-workstation:m07_lockpicking_field_guide","/#","^Lockpicking guide uploaded.","\n","^Light tension, find the binding pin, set it, repeat. Don't force it.","\n","^You're carrying picks. That keyed door doesn't need its key.","\n","^Patient hands open any of those.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"guide_recon":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"recon_guide_hint_given","re":true},"#","^give_item:lab-workstation:m07_recon_field_guide","/#","^Recon and network mapping guide sent.","\n","^Know what's on the network before you touch anything.","\n","^Their host turns up in a sweep. Find it first.","\n","^Go.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"guide_nfs":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"nfs_guide_hint_given","re":true},"#","^give_item:lab-workstation:m07_nfs_field_guide","/#","^NFS and netcat guide's on your terminal.","\n","^Read what the host shares, without changing it.","\n","^Then scan every port, not just the usual ones, and connect to anything that answers. Some services hand over more than a banner.","\n","^Read, don't touch. Go.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"guide_ssh":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"ssh_guide_hint_given","re":true},"#","^give_item:lab-workstation:m07_ssh_field_guide","/#","^SSH guide's on your terminal. The worked example's the hospital job. Skip the Hydra half; you already have the pair.","\n","^You've got a name from the share and a password from the listener. That's one login. Use it and look in the home directory.","\n","^Log in when the control room door's open, not before. Go.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"guide_privesc":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"privesc_guide_hint_given","re":true},"#","^give_item:lab-workstation:m07_privesc_field_guide","/#","^Privilege escalation guide uploaded.","\n","^Look for what they misconfigured before you think about breaking anything. The smallest step to root is the quietest.","\n","^Walk through the door they left open. Go.","\n",{"->":"hub"},null],"global decl":["ev","str","^","/str",{"VAR=":"team_assignment"},false,{"VAR=":"team_assigned"},false,{"VAR=":"projection_revised"},false,{"VAR=":"team_redirected"},false,{"VAR=":"redirect_window_closed"},"str","^","/str",{"VAR=":"hollis_resolved"},"str","^","/str",{"VAR=":"elena_outcome"},"str","^","/str",{"VAR=":"mercer_fate"},false,{"VAR=":"elena_ko"},false,{"VAR=":"hollis_ko"},false,{"VAR=":"mercer_ko"},false,{"VAR=":"grid_saved"},false,{"VAR=":"countdown_expired"},false,{"VAR=":"redirect_declined"},false,{"VAR=":"found_coordination_traffic"},false,{"VAR=":"decode_read_open"},false,{"VAR=":"revision_before_commit"},false,{"VAR=":"decode_before_commit"},false,{"VAR=":"found_tomb_gamma"},false,{"VAR=":"found_mole_evidence"},false,{"VAR=":"generator_hall_reached"},false,{"VAR=":"vault_entered"},false,{"VAR=":"debrief_requested"},false,{"VAR=":"architect_echo_heard"},false,{"VAR=":"casualty_projection_found"},false,{"VAR=":"park_ko"},"str","^","/str",{"VAR=":"park_resolved"},false,{"VAR=":"hurt_line_said"},false,{"VAR=":"cascade_armed"},false,{"VAR=":"vault_pin_found"},false,{"VAR=":"inside_reached"},false,{"VAR=":"badge_obtained"},false,{"VAR=":"server_hall_reached"},false,{"VAR=":"scada_door_reached"},false,{"VAR=":"scada_password_found"},false,{"VAR=":"flag1_submitted"},false,{"VAR=":"flag2_submitted"},false,{"VAR=":"flag3_submitted"},false,{"VAR=":"flag4_submitted"},false,{"VAR=":"rfid_guide_offered"},false,{"VAR=":"rfid_guide_hint_given"},false,{"VAR=":"lockpicking_guide_offered"},false,{"VAR=":"lockpicking_guide_hint_given"},false,{"VAR=":"recon_guide_offered"},false,{"VAR=":"recon_guide_hint_given"},false,{"VAR=":"nfs_guide_offered"},false,{"VAR=":"nfs_guide_hint_given"},false,{"VAR=":"ssh_guide_offered"},false,{"VAR=":"ssh_guide_hint_given"},false,{"VAR=":"vm_terminal_used"},false,{"VAR=":"privesc_guide_offered"},false,{"VAR=":"p